# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID, e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX
# Create a GA4 property at https://analytics.google.com → Admin → Data Streams
# → Web, then copy the "Measurement ID" here as .env.local (not committed).
#
# Leave this unset and the app still works: every event goes to the local log
# on the Customize page, and nothing is sent anywhere.
VITE_GA_ID=
